    "rich_text_NAaNX4": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_W8ijHH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Discover the Elegance of Bulk Floating Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_4Td7EC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Floating candles add a spark of sophistication and serenity to any setting. At Kisco Candles, our dripless bulk floating candles are a décor must-have for event planners, wedding coordinators, and hospitality industry professionals. Whether you're setting the mood for a romantic wedding reception or creating a tranquil atmosphere in your spa, our mess-free floating candles at wholesale prices offer an exceptional value. Explore our assortment and find the candles that will refine your space.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_W8ijHH",
        "text_4Td7EC"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left_left",
        "enable_animation": true,
