    "rich_text_9y7zjW": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_G7k84L": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Versatile Applications for Floating Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_tHi7yF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Floating candles are beautiful and incredibly versatile, making them ideal for many kinds of events and settings. Because they're available at wholesale prices, they provide a cost-effective solution for creating ambiance and elegance. Here are some popular uses for our bulk floating candles:</p><ul><li><strong>Wedding Centerpieces: </strong>Create a romantic mood by setting <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/floating-wedding-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/floating-wedding-candles\">wedding floating candles</a> adrift in decorative bowls.</li><li><strong>Spa Settings:</strong> Enhance the tranquility of spa treatments with the gentle light of floating candles.</li><li><strong>Home Decor:</strong> Refine everyday living spaces with floating candles in vases or baths for a relaxing end to the day.</li><li><strong>Special Events:</strong> From corporate dinners to holiday parties, floating candles add a sophisticated flair.</li><li><strong>Restaurants and Bars:</strong> Create intimate table settings or illuminate outdoor patios gracefully.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_G7k84L",
        "text_tHi7yF"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "alignment": "left_left",
        "enable_animation": true,
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom",
        "content_width": "custom",
        "custom_content_width": 700
      }
    },
    "rich_text_9mqHK4": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_GLd4Pt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits of Buying Our Floating Candles in Bulk",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_H8bBxW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Purchasing floating candles wholesale ensures that you have a steady supply for all your events and needs while enjoying significant cost advantages. There's no question of where to buy floating candles. At Kisco, we carry Bolsius Candles, which are crafted using plant-based wax and cotton wicks to provide a clean, smoke-free burn. Here are a few key reasons to buy our floating candles in bulk.<br/></p><h3></h3><p></p><p></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_dVbGbT": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_MNeAXT": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Economical Pricing",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_DcrApL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying in bulk enables you to access lower prices, reducing the cost per candle and significantly decreasing the overall expenses for large-scale events and business needs.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_cdW8Hj": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_YQFh4W": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Consistent Quality",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hXTtd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bolsius candles are produced under stringent quality controls, ensuring that every candle burns cleanly and evenly, maintaining both aesthetics and safety at your events.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ahzpRm": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_cJFxW6": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Access to Our Dedicated Wholesale Program",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_96zmmR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Kisco Candles, we support our wholesale buyers every step of the way. By <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/wholesale\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">participating in our wholesale program</span></a>, you gain access to exclusive pricing, personalized service, and a seamless ordering process designed to meet the demands of bulk purchases. Our team is committed to ensuring you receive the best products suited for your business or event needs, with the flexibility and support necessary to succeed.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
