          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_KtxPpW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We've answered some common questions about our bulk floating candles below. Please <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> if you'd like more information about these or any of the candles we carry.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_d6tzt9": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_MYx7NP": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What sizes do you offer for bulk floating candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xHdnBk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We have two sizes of bulk floating candles: 1.75\" x 1\" or 3\" x 1\". They're made to suit any vessel or setting, ensuring you have the right fit for your event's requirements.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_dUKKc3": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_yLyByW": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": " How long do your floating candles burn?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_3Rk76B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our floating candles burn from 5 to 8 hours, depending on their size. These extended burn times are perfect for events that go on well into the evening. <em>Specific burn times can be found on our product pages.</em></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_X8VFfc": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_U3mpic": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What is the minimum order for wholesale floating candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_86qRTJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our minimum order requirements are flexible, catering to both small gatherings and large-scale events. Details are available on the product information page. You'll see that the more you order, the more you save. </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
